repository-code: 'https://github.com/GDSALex/tungsten-sem-analyzer'
abstract: >-
  Automated detection and quantification of crack networks and
  crater-like damage in scanning electron microscopy images of
  tungsten plasma-facing components exposed to high heat flux
  transients at the OLMAT facility of CIEMAT.
keywords:
  - scanning electron microscopy
  - image segmentation
  - tungsten
  - plasma-facing components
  - nuclear fusion
license: MIT
